OL,3,GNEWSADocumentary honours BBC local
OL,4,Aradio presenter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC presenter who passed away in May
OL,7,Fis being remembered in a special
OL,8,Fdocumentary.
OL,10,FMy Emma Moment is a tribute to
OL,11,Fpresenter Emma Britton who previously
OL,12,Fhosted the breakfast programmes for
OL,13,Fboth BBC Radio Bristol and Somerset.
OL,14,FShe was diagnosed with incurable lung
OL,15,Fcancer in 2025 and died at the age of
OL,16,F52.
OL,18,FThe documentary features memories from
OL,19,Fher loved ones, colleagues and friends
OL,20,Fand will air at 09:00 and 18:00 BST on
OL,21,FBBC Radio Somerset and BBC Radio
OL,22,FBristol.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
