OL,3,GNEWSADocumentary honours BBC local
OL,4,Aradio presenter
OL,5,
OL,6,FExecutive editor at BBC Radio Somerset
OL,7,Fand Bristol Gareth Roberts said: "Emma
OL,8,Ftouched so many lives across Somerset
OL,9,Fand Bristol so we wanted to create a
OL,10,Fprogramme that gives people the chance
OL,11,Fto share their own special memories of
OL,12,Fher."
